			<h1 class="text-5xl text-white font-bold">Bruno Massocco</h1>
			<p class="text-2xl text-gray-400 mt-1">Backend developer</p>
			<h3 class="text-2xl text-green-500 mt-5">$ about me</h3>
			<p class="text-2xl text-gray-400 mt-1">Soy Técnico en programación. Recibido recientemente en la Universidad Técnologica Nacional (UTN). Especializado en el area de backend. Y profesionalizandome en automatización, DevOps y ciberseguridad.</p>
			<h3 class="text-2xl text-green-500 mt-5">$ techs</h3>
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2 max-w-full">
				<div class="inline-flex bg-[#112319] opacity-95 justify-center items-center h-10 px-4 mt-3 rounded-sm border border-green-800 mr-2">
					<span class="text-[20px] text-white">Python</span>
				</div>
				<div class="inline-flex bg-[#112319] opacity-95 justify-center items-center h-10 px-4 mt-3 rounded-sm border border-green-800">
					<span class="text-[20px] text-white">Node.js</span>
				</div>
				<div class="inline-flex bg-[#112319] opacity-95 justify-center items-center h-10 px-4 mt-3 rounded-sm border border-green-800 ml-2">
					<span class="text-[20px] text-white">C#</span>
				</div>
				<div class="inline-flex bg-[#112319] opacity-95 justify-center items-center h-10 px-4 mt-3 rounded-sm border border-green-800 ml-2">
